<title>HUNGARY: Human Q1 97 profit HUF205.6mln vs 199.6mln.</title>
<headline>Human Q1 97 profit HUF205.6mln vs 199.6mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three-month period ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Jan-March 1997   Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	173.5	 vs     204.0</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	  205.6	 vs     199.6</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit	205.6	 vs     199.6</p>
<p>    Group net sales	     4,033.8	 vs   3,368.6</p>
<p>	Net domestic sales	3,432.0	 vs   3,076.3</p>
<p>	Export sales		  601.8	 vs     292.3</p>
<p>    Group other revenue	    20.3	 vs	17.3</p>
<p>    Material expenditures     3,365.3	 vs   2,713.8</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures	462.6	 vs     330.3</p>
<p>    Depreciation		    118.4	 vs	79.2</p>
<p>    Group other costs	     107.3	 vs	73.2</p>
<p>    Group other expenditures     98.4	 vs	94.9</p>
<p>    Net financial income	   32.8 profit vs	2.2 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	    51.6	 vs	15.5</p>
<p>	Financial expenditures     18.8	 vs	17.7</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	0.6 loss  vs	 2.2 loss</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue	 0.0	 vs	 2.0</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expenditures  0.6	 vs	 4.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Human Oltoanyagtermelo es Gyogyszergyarto Rt is a pharmaceuticals company. The figures are consolidated, are not audited and were calculated in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>Human is majority owned by Canada's Novopharm Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
